{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"I see, so <STYLE ID="3">Ryoji-san</STYLE>'s gone back home for Obon. 
{PAUSE ""}
Why didn't <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> go with him?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"???"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm quitting pachinko!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"What's wrong? So serious all of a sudden..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The truth is... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> hates women who gamble, like on pachinko or horse racing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh!?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So please! Keep today a secret!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I don't mind keeping it a secret, but... 
{PAUSE ""}
still, I'm impressed you managed to hide it all this time..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"When I graduated high school, I tried pachinko with my friends, half for fun... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">At first I only meant to do a little, okay!? I only meant to do just a tiny bit!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　But listen, listen! Out of nowhere, 3,000 yen turned into 30,000 yen, you know!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Isn't that amazing!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"O-okay..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I really did only mean to do a little... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">But only as much as doesn't squeeze my wallet, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If you hid it even from me, it must be pretty bad..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>You<STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ryoji-kun</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> know each other, so I just had to..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ母.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This Obon, the newest machine came out in the series I got hooked on 2 years ago... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I knew I shouldn't, but..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Could it be... 
{PAUSE ""}
the reason you didn't go home with <STYLE ID="3">Ryoji-san</STYLE> is..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes, yes, that's right! I wanted to play Lucy Doll 3!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Lucy's a little doll with odd eyes, one green and one blue... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">She's sooo cute, I'm telling you..."</STYLE><PG>
"N-now, now, calm down... 
{PAUSE ""}
But you can't keep playing pachinko forever, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's why... I'm quitting... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">The guilt I feel right now is seriously no joke..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
