"Getting so into it you won't even go along when your <STYLE ID="3">husband</STYLE> visits home, that really is a bit much..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's not it! I didn't get into pachinko, I wanted to see Lucy!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　This one was really amazing! She's sooo cute!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
