{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"So, </STYLE>Mifuyu<STYLE ID="1">! I promise! I'm quitting pachinko!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Sh-shouldn't you be promising <STYLE ID="3">Ryoji-san</STYLE> instead of me..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Like I could tell him!!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If he found out... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">we'd be facing divorce right after getting married... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Ugh, honestly... I'm such a hopeless woman..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
