<STYLE ID="1">"I can't go against </STYLE>you<STYLE ID="1"> right now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">At least, when we have a kid, I hope this gambling streak doesn't get passed down..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
